       pprreeaadd() can fail and set _e_r_r_n_o to any error specified  for  rreeaadd(2)  or
       llsseeeekk(2).   ppwwrriittee()  can fail and set _e_r_r_n_o to any error specified for
       wwrriittee(2) or llsseeeekk(2).

